WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.761
Mandy, Vinnie, and Gildong stood outside the nobleman's house, listening.

2
00:00:07.762 --> 00:00:12.684
"Where is the music coming from?" wondered Mandy.

3
00:00:12.685 --> 00:00:16.192
She pointed toward a group of houses.

4
00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:19.918
"Maybe it's coming from over there."

5
00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:23.061
"No." Gildong shook his head.

6
00:00:23.062 --> 00:00:25.697
"It's coming from over there."

7
00:00:25.698 --> 00:00:29.526
Just then a girl raced toward them.

8
00:00:29.527 --> 00:00:33.417
She slammed into Gildong, knocking him down.

9
00:00:33.418 --> 00:00:37.975
"Oh!" cried the girl, falling too.

10
00:00:37.976 --> 00:00:41.383
Gildong stood and rubbed his arm.

11
00:00:41.384 --> 00:00:45.859
"Aren't you going to say sorry?" he snapped.

12
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:49.790
"For what?" The girl dusted off her skirt.

13
00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:52.656
"You were in my way."

14
00:00:52.657 --> 00:00:55.508
Mandy stepped in between them.

15
00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:59.480
"My name is Mandy," she said to the girl.

16
00:00:59.481 --> 00:01:01.597
"What's yours?"

17
00:01:01.598 --> 00:01:09.217
"I'm . . . uh . . . well . . ." The girl's cheeks turned pink.

18
00:01:09.218 --> 00:01:13.269
"It's a secret," she said finally.

19
00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:17.127
At that Gildong finally smiled.

20
00:01:17.128 --> 00:01:22.104
"That's your name—'a secret'?" he said with a grin.

21
00:01:22.105 --> 00:01:24.987
"No!" said the girl.

22
00:01:24.988 --> 00:01:28.297
But she was smiling too.

23
00:01:28.298 --> 00:01:31.972
"What's that?" she asked suddenly.

24
00:01:31.973 --> 00:01:34.899
She could also hear music now.

25
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:38.369
"I've never heard anything like that before."

26
00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:41.351
Gildong looked at her strangely.

27
00:01:41.352 --> 00:01:43.308
"Well, then let's go!"

28
00:01:43.309 --> 00:01:46.701
he said, running toward the sound.

29
00:01:46.702 --> 00:01:49.409
The others raced after him.

30
00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:52.264
"Look!" cried Mandy.

31
00:01:52.265 --> 00:01:58.234
A group of men were playing instruments and dancing in a large circle.

32
00:01:58.235 --> 00:02:01.862
The girl was amazed.

33
00:02:01.863 --> 00:02:04.926
"What is this?" she asked.

34
00:02:04.927 --> 00:02:09.711
"You don't know?" Gildong looked at her, surprised.

35
00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:13.059
"It's a peasant band!" he said.

36
00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.755
"They are celebrating the harvest."

37
00:02:15.756 --> 00:02:21.081
"Everyone is having so much fun," said Mandy.

38
00:02:21.082 --> 00:02:27.164
"Wow!" said Vinnie when one man began twirling wildly.

39
00:02:27.165 --> 00:02:29.193
"Look at that!"

40
00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:35.152
Some people danced to the beat while the crowd cheered for the performers.

41
00:02:35.153 --> 00:02:39.834
Mandy listened to a musician play a small horn.

42
00:02:39.835 --> 00:02:44.692
"Oh! He's really good!" she said.

43
00:02:44.693 --> 00:02:48.038
The girl watched with a huge smile.

44
00:02:48.039 --> 00:02:53.137
But when the band stopped playing, she stepped away from the crowd.

45
00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:56.545
There was an odd look on her face.

46
00:02:56.546 --> 00:03:00.002
"What's wrong?" Mandy asked her.

47
00:03:00.003 --> 00:03:03.840
"I think I’m lost . . . ," the girl said.

48
00:03:03.841 --> 00:03:06.540
"My home is far from here."

49
00:03:06.541 --> 00:03:11.181
Then she looked nervously at Gildong.

50
00:03:11.182 --> 00:03:14.340
"Do you know how to get to the palace?"

51
00:03:14.341 --> 00:03:17.953
"The palace!" Gildong burst out.

52
00:03:17.954 --> 00:03:21.373
"Why do you need to go to the palace?"

53
00:03:21.374 --> 00:03:24.434
The girl stepped closer to them.

54
00:03:24.435 --> 00:03:28.610
"Can you keep a secret?" she whispered.

55
00:03:28.611 --> 00:03:31.490
"Yes," said Vinnie.

56
00:03:31.491 --> 00:03:34.782
"Of course!" answered Mandy.

57
00:03:34.783 --> 00:03:38.960
"The palace is my home," the girl said.

58
00:03:38.961 --> 00:03:41.415
"I am a princess."

59
00:03:41.416 --> 00:03:45.723
The children stared at the girl in surprise.

60
00:03:45.724 --> 00:03:51.372
"What?" cried Mandy. "You're a princess?"

61
00:03:51.373 --> 00:03:55.335
"What are you doing here?" asked Gildong.

62
00:03:55.336 --> 00:04:00.994
"I wanted to see the world outside the palace," the girl explained.

63
00:04:00.995 --> 00:04:08.121
"So I put on my servant's clothing and I escaped."

